      "-m",
      "Cache deterministic policies in the custom-provider sample",
      "-m",
      "Opt the internal MinimumAgePolicyProvider sample into the existing endpoint policy cache. Keep parsing, direct policy construction, handler evaluation and framework defaults unchanged. Explain dynamic-provider opt-out and endpoint lifetime. Add two real HTTP cache-contract rows, each individually red with two original lookups and green with one candidate lookup. Three permanently closed comparisons show 1246/1258/1269 reported B/op saved at the primary TestServer route; noisy timing does not demonstrate a speedup. Real controller-attribute Hot Reload 10->11->10 applies without app restart. Narrow allocation-focused draft, not general framework throughput or merge-ready.",
